# Who has to review a change before it merges (#914). The `protect main` ruleset requires a
# code owner's review, so every file below the owner's line needs their approval.
*                                   @marcusbandit

# The iPhone's and the Mac's own files have no owner, so a PR touching only these merges
# without a review. Keep this list the same as ONLY in .github/ios-automerge.sh.
/apps/android/ios/
/apps/android/src/**/ios.rs
/apps/android/src/**/ios/
/apps/android/src/**/metal.rs
/apps/android/scripts/*ios*
/apps/android/changes/
/apps/linux/packaging/macos/
